{
  "name": "Google Hotels prices to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Hotels prices to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, fetch hotel prices, booking-site rates and ratings from Google Hotels for the cities you list, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get Google Hotels prices** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get Google Hotels prices** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** from $2 per 1,000 hotels. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/google-hotels-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "8ccbf18e-d966-4e2e-bd3d-1c1cd0bae9c8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d5cb13c1-9d15-495f-aee2-11b6ccde612b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/om_kh~google-hotels-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"locations\": [\n    \"Lisbon\"\n  ],\n  \"maxHotelsPerLocation\": 40,\n  \"maxTotalChargeUsd\": 0.5\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
